      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "있지, 새포켓몬에도\n여러 종류가 있잖아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C788C9C0002C0020C0C8D3ECCF13BAACC5D0B3C4000AC5ECB7EC0020C885B958AC000020C788C796C544003F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 내 취향은 역시\n구구! 피죤! 피죤투란 말이지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020B0B40020CDE8D5A5C7400020C5EDC2DC000AAD6CAD6C00210020D53CC8E400210020D53CC8E4D22CB7800020B9D0C774C9C0002100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금 다니는 배달 회사에 입사한 것도\n회사 마크가 새포켓몬이라서야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...파이어로 마크지만.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE080020B2E4B2C8B2940020BC30B2EC0020D68CC0ACC5D00020C785C0ACD55C0020AC83B3C4000AD68CC0AC0020B9C8D06CAC000020C0C8D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CC11CC57C002100100001BE01000A002E002E002ED30CC774C5B4B85C0020B9C8D06CC9C0B9CC002E00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "피죤투 계열이 쓰는\n공중날기 기술은 엄청 대단하다고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D53CC8E4D22C0020ACC4C5F4C7740020C4F0B294000AACF5C911B0A0AE300020AE30C220C7400020C5C4CCAD0020B300B2E8D558B2E4ACE0002100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어때? 구구, 피죤, 피죤투의\n공중날기 공격을 맛보지 않겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B54C003F0020AD6CAD6C002C0020D53CC8E4002C0020D53CC8E4D22CC758000AACF5C911B0A0AE300020ACF5ACA9C7440020B9DBBCF4C9C00020C54AACA0C5B4003F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무나도 매력 넘치는 피죤투 팀과\n승부해 보고 싶으면 말을 걸어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB34B098B3C40020B9E4B8250020B118CE58B2940020D53CC8E4D22C0020D300ACFC000AC2B9BD80D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C73CBA740020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 피죤투 팀과 싸워 보면\n이 녀석들의 매력을 너도 알게 될 거야.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어때? 당연히 승부할 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D53CC8E4D22C0020D300ACFC0020C2F8C6CC0020BCF4BA74000AC7740020B140C11DB4E4C7580020B9E4B825C7440020B108B3C40020C54CAC8C0020B4200020AC70C57C002E00100001BE00000AC5B4B54C003F0020B2F9C5F0D7880020C2B9BD80D5600020AC70C9C0003F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러지 말고 승부해 주라!\n피죤투 팀의 매력을 너도 알아 달라구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC9C00020B9D0ACE00020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCB77C0021000AD53CC8E4D22C0020D300C7580020B9E4B825C7440020B108B3C40020C54CC5440020B2ECB77CAD6C002100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋았어! 그럼 먼저, 구구!\n하늘 높이 날아라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC558C5B400210020ADF8B7FC0020BA3CC800002C0020AD6CAD6C0021000AD558B2980020B192C7740020B0A0C544B77C002100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
